# The serving image copies models/, src/, scripts/serve.py and deploy/ and
# nothing else, so this file is about build-context SIZE: ~130 MB of
# datasets, training runs, demo footage and detector weights would otherwise
# be tarred up and handed to the daemon on every build.
#
# Patterns are ANCHORED (leading /) wherever they name an image artefact:
# a bare `*.png` would also drop models/tags/*.png, which are the apriltag
# textures the robot's cameras read -- the world loads, the tags are blank,
# and the robot never finds the rack.
.git/
datasets/
runs/
protocol/
tests/
docs/
e2e/
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.mp4
/*.gif
/*.pt
/*.onnx
/MUJOCO_LOG.TXT
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
